  "outcome_detail": "Interlocutory ruling on the preliminary issue of locus standi: the Court held that the Petitioner, acting in the public interest, has sufficient standing under Articles 1(5), 2 and 128 of the Constitution as read with section 11(2)(c) of the Constitutional Court Act No. 8 of 2016. The Court ordered that the matter proceed to trial in open Court on 29 July 2025. No order as to costs.",
